Attribution. If you use this dataset or code, please cite the accompanying
article: "Member-size reversal of in-place concrete strength: FBG-monitored
maturity for formwork removal" (under review, Case Studies in Construction
Materials). A DOI-archived snapshot will be referenced in the final version.

Provenance notice. The literature portion of the strength-maturity records
was extracted from published primary studies identified in
Supplementary_Dataset/SI_sources.csv; users who redistribute or reuse
subsets of the data should preserve these source attributions. The cube and
slab measurements are original data of the authors.
